      "source_handle": "P0573",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "To address the inconsistency in clinical outcomes when combining FMT with ICIs, elucidate the underlying mechanisms of this interaction, identify key factors influencing efficacy, and provide a framework for optimizing FMT strategies to enhance immunotherapy response.",
